    //
    // Intentionally empty: this coverpoint cannot be expressed in pure functional
    // coverage. The "nonaffecting" case (e.g. vfadd.vv with vs1_val == vs2_val
    // == 0) requires proving that mstatus.FS *did not* transition out of
